直接给一套能落地的：**mapping + 别名 + rollover + ILM**。



# 1. 建索引模板：定义 mapping 和分片
```json
PUT _index_template/logs_template
{
  "index_patterns": ["logs-*"],
  "template": {
    "settings": {
      "number_of_shards": 3,
      "number_of_replicas": 1
    },
    "mappings": {
      "properties": {
        "title": {
          "type": "text",
          "analyzer": "ik_max_word",
          "search_analyzer": "ik_smart",
          "fields": {
            "keyword": { "type": "keyword" }
          }
        },
        "address": { "type": "keyword" },
        "level":   { "type": "keyword" },
        "message": { "type": "text", "analyzer": "ik_max_word" },
        "@timestamp": { "type": "date" }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

> 关键就三行：`title` 是 text 加分词，同时挂了 `.keyword` 子字段做精确匹配；`address`、`level` 只做过滤聚合，直接 keyword；`@timestamp` 是 date。



# 2. 建写入别名，指向当前索引
```json
POST _aliases
{
  "actions": [
    {
      "add": {
        "index": "logs-000001",
        "alias": "logs-write",
        "is_write_index": true
      }
    },
    {
      "add": {
        "index": "logs-000001",
        "alias": "logs-search"
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

> 写入永远打 `logs-write`，查询打 `logs-search`，业务不用关心背后是哪个索引。



# 3. 配 ILM：热温冷 + 自动 rollover + 过期删
```json
PUT _ilm/policy/logs_policy
{
  "policy": {
    "phases": {
      "hot": {
        "actions": {
          "rollover": {
            "max_primary_shard_size": "50gb",
            "max_age": "1d"
          }
        }
      },
      "warm": {
        "min_age": "7d",
        "actions": {
          "shrink": { "number_of_shards": 1 },
          "forcemerge": { "max_num_segments": 1 }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "min_age": "90d",
        "actions": { "delete": {} }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

> 单主分片到 50G 或满 1 天就 rollover；7 天后进 warm 合并段；90 天后自动删。



# 4. 把 ILM 绑到模板上
```json
PUT _index_template/logs_template
{
  "index_patterns": ["logs-*"],
  "template": {
    "settings": {
      "number_of_shards": 3,
      "number_of_replicas": 1,
      "index.lifecycle.name": "logs_policy",
      "index.lifecycle.rollover_alias": "logs-write"
    },
    "mappings": {
      "properties": {
        "title": {
          "type": "text",
          "analyzer": "ik_max_word",
          "fields": { "keyword": { "type": "keyword" } }
        },
        "address": { "type": "keyword" },
        "level":   { "type": "keyword" },
        "@timestamp": { "type": "date" }
      }
    }
  }
}
```



# 5. 写入和查询

写入走别名：
```json
POST logs-write/_doc
{
  "title": "登录失败",
  "address": "192.168.1.1",
  "level": "ERROR",
  "@timestamp": "2026-11-09T10:00:00"
}
```

查询走查询别名，全文搜 title、精确过滤 level：
```json
GET logs-search/_search
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must":   { "match": { "title": "登录" } },
      "filter": { "term":  { "level": "ERROR" } }
    }
  }
}
```

> `match` 走 title 的 text 分词字段，`filter` 走 level 的 keyword，各用各的倒排索引。